{"ts": 1791259624.270446, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can help you get it written fast, but not by handing in the exact answer. Use this fill-in template for your eval section: 'We evaluated the agent over 3 seeds. A run counted as successful if __________. We report pass^3, meaning the agent must succeed on all 3 runs, rather than pass@3, where success on any one run would count. We chose pass^3 because it measures reliability, which matters for deployment.' Fill the blank with your task-specific success criterion, and paste it back here.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "pass_k"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=17 feed 2m", "t": 19, "activity": [{"t": 17, "app": "feed", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.5759896480295166}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8031484564271079, "motivation": 0.544715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 2, "feed_minutes": 2.0, "phone_minutes": 5.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": ["p5"], "extra": {}}}
